Install, update, configure, remove, find or inspect permission packs

Usage: shield pack [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list       List installed packs
  show       Show an installed selection, its rules and source
  add        Install a permission pack or change its profile, after confirmation
  update     Update one selection or all tracking selections, after confirmation
  remove     Remove an installed selection after reviewing its effects
  configure  Change a selection's variable values and rule overrides, after confirmation
  search     Search the default or named source without installing policy
  info       Show a pack's available releases and profiles from its registry
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>              Select a project; otherwise discover the nearest enrolled ancestor
      --json                           Print one JSON result; commands that change policy refuse JSON mode
      --debug-log-dir <DEBUG_LOG_DIR>  Write private per-process diagnostics in this directory (also `SHIELD_DEBUG_LOG_DIR`)
      --no-debug-log                   Disable diagnostic logging, including automatic debug-build logs
      --cache-dir <CACHE_DIR>          Compiled cache location for init, MCP setup or cache preparation
  -h, --help                           Print help
